guide polestar-completionist-horde/unplaced-quests
title Quests the data cannot place (Completionist)
faction Horde
category Miscellaneous
levels 1-60
zone Orgrimmar
pitch A checklist: the quests Polestar's reference data names but cannot lead to.

step About this guide
  note The reference data has no giver, hand-in, level or zone for these quests, so no guide can lead to them. Each is listed by its title for you to find and tick off. Some may not be in the game.

step Alterac Valley
  task "Launch the Attack!, level 60" optional -- quest 6901

step Ironforge
  task "Your Reward has Arrived!" optional -- quest 60860

step No zone in the data
  task "A Ticking Present, level 40" optional -- quest 79637
